                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;MGSDEV=/tmp/lustre-mgs sh llmount.sh:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;./../tests/test-framework.sh: line 4561: [: /tmp/lustre-mgs: unary operator expected&lt;br/&gt;
./../tests/test-framework.sh: line 4561: [: /tmp/lustre-mgs: unary operator expected&lt;br/&gt;
./../tests/test-framework.sh: line 4561: [: /tmp/lustre-mgs: unary operator expected&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;that's because MDSDEV1 is not defined in mgsdevname():&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
        &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;case&lt;/span&gt; $fstype in
        ldiskfs )
                &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; [ $(facet_host mgs) = $(facet_host mds1) ] &amp;amp;&amp;amp;
                  ( [ -z &lt;span class="code-quote"&gt;"$MGSDEV"&lt;/span&gt; ] || [ $MGSDEV = $MDSDEV1 ] ); then
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
